[{"category":"section","location":"#PDESystemLibrary.jl","page":"Home","text":"","title":"PDESystemLibrary.jl"},{"category":"function","location":"#PDESystemLibrary.get_pdesys_with_tags","page":"Home","text":"get_pdesys_with_tags(withtags; without = [], f = all)\n\nReturn PDE systems whose metadata tags match withtags.\n\nArguments\n\nwithtags: An iterable of tags to include in the result.\n\nKeywords\n\nwithout = []: Tags that exclude a system from the result.\nf = all: Predicate that combines matches for withtags. Use any to select systems matching at least one requested tag.\n\nExamples\n\ndiffusion_systems = get_pdesys_with_tags([\"Diffusion\"])\none_dimensional_or_heat = get_pdesys_with_tags([\"1D\", \"Heat\"]; f = any)\nsmooth_diffusion = get_pdesys_with_tags([\"Diffusion\"]; without = [\"Discontinuous\"])\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"PDESystemLibrary.get_pdesys_with_tags"}]
